	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Sluuuuuuuurp.\![set,balloonwait,1] Ahh..."
	"Pop. Pop. Pop. Pop."
	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Shhrrrrrrr.\![set,balloonwait,1]"
	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Fwshhhhhh.\![set,balloonwait,1]"
	"Splut. Splut."
	"Bop. Bop. Bop. Bop."
	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Shrrrrrrrip.\![set,balloonwait,1]"
	"Scratch scratch. Scratch scratch scratch."
	"Skritch skritch skritch."
	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Shhhhhhvv.\![set,balloonwait,1]"
	"Tapatapatapatapatapatapatapatapa."
	"Tappata tappata tappata tappata tappata."
	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Vrrrrrrrp.\![set,balloonwait,1]"
	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Slllllllp.\![set,balloonwait,1]"
	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Crrrrrrrrck\![set,balloonwait,1], crk, crk, crk."
	"Pup. Pop. Pip. Pup."
	
	//Affirmations (aka LIES)
	"You matter. Your contributions to snail culture will be remembered."
	"There's no other snail that's exactly like you, you're unique and wonderful."
	"You can win eventually if you keep trying."
	"Go get a nice shell wash, it'll help you feel better."
	"You're the most important snail in somebody's life."
	"Your sponsor loves you."
	"Your sense of style is impeccable."
	"You're the fastest snail on the track."
	"Your shell's curve is perfect, don't let anyone tell you otherwise."
	"You did a fine job applying those stickers to your own shell, they look great."
	"Your new paint job suits you well."
	"You deserve all the lettuce in the world."
	"If you don't feel like racing today, that's ok."
	"Go to the refrigerator, get a snack. You deserve it."
	"You'll make it big one day."
	"We're all so proud of you."
	"You'll impress everyone at your next race, the crowds will roar."
	"Ask your sponsor to mist you now and then, you deserve the extra attention and care."
	"Imagine the juicy crunch of a fresh lettuce leaf. You deserve the best today."
	"Your racer name is one of the best anyone's ever heard. You'll be legendary one day."
}

ASMR.dialogues.sylance : array
{
	"Shuff shuff shuff shuff."
	"Splip... Splop... Splip... Splop..."
	"Sclup... Sclup..."
	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Vrrrrrrrrp.\![set,balloonwait,1] Skt skt skt skt."
	"Crick crick. Crick. \w8\w8Crack."
	"Shoof shoof shoof. Shoof shoof shoof. \![set,balloonwait,2]Shhhhrrrrrp.\![set,balloonwait,1]"
	"Tap tap tap tap. Shoof shoof. Tap tap tap tap tap tap."
	"Bip bip bip. Bip. Bip bip."
	"Bup bup. Bup bup bup."
	"Blit blit. Blit blop. Splob splob splob."
	"Skv skv skv skv. Vvvvvp."
	"Clink clink."
	"Tink tink tink. Tink tink. Tink tink tink."
	"Click clack. Click clack. Click clack."
	"Fuzz fuzz fuzz fuzz."
	"Pop pop pop pop."
	"Fssszzzzzzz."
	"Sizzle."
	"Pop. Pop. Crackle. Pop."
	"Plop. Plop. Plop."
	"Drip. Drop."
	"Dit dit dit dit dit."
	"Tip tip tap. Tip tip tap. Tip tip tap."
	"Shrp. Shrp. Shrp. Shrp. \![set,balloonwait,2]Shrrrrrrrriiip.\![set,balloonwait,1]"
	"Tep tep tep. Tep tep tep tep tep. Tep tep."
	"Bip bip bip bip bip."
	"Squish."
	"Squish squorsh. Squish squorsh."
	"Blep. Blep. Blep."
	"Pip pip pop. Pip pip pop."
	
	//Roleplay ???
	"Let's wash that shell.\n\n Squee. Squee. Squee.\n\n So shiny."
	"Let's get a little mist.\n\n Shhp. Shhp. Shhp.\n\n Well hydrated."
	"I got this lettuce fresh, just for you.\n\n Crunch. Crunch. Crunch.\n\n Mmm, taste those nutrients."
	"Let's check the refrigerator.\n\n \![set,balloonwait,2]Ch-wummmmmmm\![set,balloonwait,1].\n\n Look at all that produce. All for you."
	"Look at this brand new engine.\n\n Tappata tappata tappata tap.\n\n Skitter skitter skitter skitter.\n\n Sounds nice, doesn't it? Just imagine when it roars to life on the track."
	"Look at this big trophy you got for winning that race.\n\n Tap tap tap tap.\n\n Solid gold. And it's even got your name on it."
	"Your big race is coming up soon. Imagine yourself there on the track.\n\n \![set,balloonwait,2]Vroom... Vroom vroom.\![set,balloonwait,1]\n\n The crowd goes wild. It's your time to shine."
	"Come out to the garden with me, we'll pick tomatoes together.\n\n Pip. Pip. Pip.\n\n Here, this one's for you. Mmmmm."
	"Here, let's change those tires.\n\n Vrr. Vrr. Vrr. Vrr. Vrr.\n\n Clunk. Shove.\n\n Vrr. Vrr. Vrr. Vrr. Vrr.\n\n There we are, good as new."
	"Have you been doing shell presses? It shows. Look at those muscles."
	"Let's shine that medal you got yesterday.\n\n Rub. Rub. Rub. Rub.\n\n Look at it gleam."
	"Look, it's that ribbon you won the other day.\n\n Rustle rustle.\n\n Flutter flutter.\n\n The sound of a winner."
	"Let me check your racer ID card.\n\n Scrape scrape. \![set,balloonwait,2]Scrape.\![set,balloonwait,1]\n\n Looks good, you can proceed onto the track."
	"It's raining outside, hear it against the window?\n\n Pitter patter. Pitter patter. Pitter patter.\n\n Drip. Drop. Drip. Drop.\n\n It's nice, isn't it? We'll go out later while it's still all damp."
	"Bring your shell here and we'll polish it.\n\n Skrr. Skrr. Skrr.\n\n Scrub. Scrub. Scrub.\n\n There we are. All nice and smooth."
	"Wait here, I'll pack you a nice lunch for today.\n\n Chop. Chop. Chop.\n\n Rustle. Rustle. Rustle.\n\n Shv. Shv. Shv.\n\n Zzzzzzip!\n\n There you are. Full of all your favorite greens."
	"Do you want some %(celery)?\n\n Chop. Chop. Chop. Chop.\n\n There you are. Fresh and cool from the fridge, just for you."
	"Go out and explore the garden.\n\n Swish. Swish. Swish.\n\n Feel those blades of grass. So safe and cozy."
	"Let me clean your glasses.\n\n Rub. Rub. Rub.\n\n There. You can see much better now, can't you?"
	"Let's put these new stickers on your shell.\n\n Peeeeeeeeel. Swsh. Swsh. Swsh.\n\n There's one.\e:chain=chain.applying_stickers" //TODO test that this works with the special setup i gave it above lol
}

